        <h2 class="tcard-city">The Kathiawad Circuit</h2>
        <p class="tcard-desc">A slow traverse through the Saurashtra peninsula — Rajkot, Jamnagar, Bhavnagar, Palitana — tracing how a distinct regional urbanism survived centuries of trade, colonial rule, and post-independence planning. The <em>pol</em> neighbourhoods, the <em>khancha</em> lanes, the stepwells: a complete urban vocabulary that modern planning has largely ignored.</p>
